## 8. Privacy

Our MemorySafe Beta Privacy Policy explains how information is handled. It forms part of these Terms. Automatic Mode consent is separate from acceptance of these Terms.

## 9. Security and your responsibilities

You are responsible for keeping your device, ChatGPT account, API or runtime credentials, and local files secure. Do not share access keys in chats or support messages. The Beta does not currently add application-level encryption to the local MemorySafe database; protection depends in part on your device and operating-system security settings.

No system is completely secure. Notify us promptly at contact@memorysafe.ca if you believe the Beta or your MemorySafe data has been compromised.

